{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27269455","formula":"C₁₆H₁₅FN₆OS","hill":"C16H15FN6OS","elements":["H","C","N","O","F","S"],"composition":{"C":16.0,"F":1.0,"H":15.0,"N":6.0,"O":1.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Fezolinetant","uk":"Фезолінетант"},"descriptions":{"en":"Fezolinetant, sold under the brand name Veozah, among others, is a medication used for the treatment of hot flashes (vasomotor symptoms) due to menopause. It is a small-molecule, selective neurokinin-3 (NK3) receptor antagonist taken by mouth. It was developed by Astellas Pharma, which acquired it from Ogeda (formerly Euroscreen) in April 2017.","uk":"Фезолінетант (англ. Fezolinetant), який продається під торговою маркою «Веоза» — це препарат, що використовується для лікування припливів, спричинених менопаузою. Це низькомолекулярний селективний антагоніст нейрокінінових рецепторів NK3, який приймається перорально."},"fame":12,"pubchemCid":117604931,"mass":358.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@@H]1C2=NN=C(N2CCN1C(=O)C3=CC=C(C=C3)F)C4=NC(=NS4)C","inchikey":"PPSNFPASKFYPMN-SECBINFHSA-N","iupac":"(4-fluorophenyl)-[(8R)-8-methyl-3-(3-methyl-1,2,4-thiadiazol-5-yl)-6,8-dihydro-5H-[1,2,4]triazolo[4,3-a]pyrazin-7-yl]methanone","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"117604931","atoms":40,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.749,"y":1.277,"z":-0.703,"el":"C"},{"x":0.936,"y":-0.02,"z":-0.742,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.419,"y":0.254,"z":-1.309,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.803,"y":0.265,"z":-2.566,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.131,"y":0.632,"z":-2.59,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.533,"y":0.842,"z":-1.349,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.485,"y":0.582,"z":-0.517,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.376,"y":0.586,"z":0.92,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.435,"y":-0.533,"z":1.358,"el":"C"},{"x":0.833,"y":-0.619,"z":0.615,"el":"N"},{"x":1.846,"y":-1.366,"z":1.223,"el":"C"},{"x":1.762,"y":-1.807,"z